{"id":"n64542-1-14","stage":1,"title":"도움 · 帮助","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64542-1-14-1","ko":"지난번에 제가 보내 드린 자료는 받으셨습니까?","zh":"上次我发给您的资料您收到了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난번에","meaning":"上次，上回","explanation":"지난번：上次，上回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난번","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71316","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보내","meaning":"发送","explanation":"보내다：发送；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"10","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드린","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자료는","meaning":"资料","explanation":"자료：资料；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"자료","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62401","senseId":"1","lemma":"자료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받으셨습니까?","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0c2f1df517822c1f","term":"지난번","zh":"上次，上回","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3","entryId":"71316","definition":"以正在说话时为准，指过去的时候。","pronunciation":["지난번"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"发送","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"使内容被传达。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"6416867e47259489","term":"자료","zh":"资料","audio":"/audio/6416867e472594899d64.mp3","entryId":"62401","definition":"做研究或调查最基本的材料。","pronunciation":["자료"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/53fa9a3c5f2130eeaca0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64542-1-14-2","ko":"네. 큰 도움이 되었습니다. 감사합니다.","zh":"收到了。帮了大忙，谢谢您。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰","meaning":"重，重大，严重","explanation":"크다：重，重大，严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"3","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도움이","meaning":"帮助，帮忙，援助","explanation":"도움：帮助，帮忙，援助；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"도움","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64542","senseId":"1","lemma":"도움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되었습니다.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감사합니다.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"감사하다：感谢，感激；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"감사하다","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71728","senseId":"1","lemma":"감사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"重，重大，严重","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"某事的规模、范围、程度、力量等都超过了一般水平。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"8d901cc28dffe7ee","term":"도움","zh":"帮助，帮忙，援助","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3","entryId":"64542","definition":"帮扶他人的事宜。","pronunciation":["도움"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"552d49e405b9383e","term":"감사하다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/552d49e405b9383e0803.mp3","entryId":"71728","definition":"觉得感恩。","pronunciation":["감ː사하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d76f32005df2184ee68f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64542","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequenceScore":2.4691,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["收到了。帮了大忙，谢谢您。","上次我发给您的资料您收到了吗？","智秀，你定新年计划了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["上次我发给您的资料您收到了吗？","智秀，你定新年计划了吗？","收到了。帮了大忙，谢谢您。"],"answer":2}]}
